575
00:44:22,640 --> 00:44:24,560
I’ll carefully craft it.

576
00:44:26,840 --> 00:44:27,680
Asshole, Hong.

577
00:44:29,240 --> 00:44:30,840
You think you are the real deal?

578
00:44:31,760 --> 00:44:32,680
You think you are the real deal?

579
00:44:36,040 --> 00:44:36,680
Sen.

580
00:44:37,640 --> 00:44:38,360
Let me go.

581
00:44:40,560 --> 00:44:41,880
