586
00:45:08,120 --> 00:45:09,280
They are just kids.

587
00:45:11,320 --> 00:45:13,000
They can be useful 
if you put them in the right job.

588
00:45:14,640 --> 00:45:17,760
Please let them go as a favor to me.

589
00:45:19,760 --> 00:45:20,960
If they cause any problem, 

590
00:45:22,240 --> 00:45:24,080
