602
00:46:24,480 --> 00:46:25,280
You should put the weapons away.

603
00:46:25,840 --> 00:46:28,360
Sen, did Boss Aang save you?

604
00:46:29,080 --> 00:46:30,800
Are you working for him?

605
00:46:32,160 --> 00:46:33,080
What is it?

606
00:46:38,440 --> 00:46:39,320
I rejected his offer.

607
00:46:40,520 --> 00:46:41,960
f you have a problem with that, 

608
00:46:43,600 --> 00:46:44,640
you can leave my gang.

609
00:47:02,560 --> 00:47:03,160
Zeng.

610
00:47:03,960 --> 00:47:04,880
Did you call me here?

611
00:47:06,200 --> 00:47:06,680
Yes.

612
00:47:07,000 --> 00:47:07,680
What’s up?

613
00:47:12,040 --> 00:47:13,040
