614
00:47:18,040 --> 00:47:18,720
Fine. Move.

615
00:47:19,320 --> 00:47:20,040
Move where?

616
00:47:20,360 --> 00:47:22,040
I’m the rider. You are a passenger.

617
00:47:23,240 --> 00:47:25,440
