650
00:51:30,280 --> 00:51:31,120
I have another thing to tell you.

651
00:51:34,960 --> 00:51:35,840
I believe you.

652
00:51:38,120 --> 00:51:40,360
You told me that you didn’t kill Suea Yai.

653
00:51:43,600 --> 00:51:44,400
I believe you.

654
00:51:46,480 --> 00:51:47,680
Why do you believe me?

655
00:51:51,240 --> 00:51:52,440
I just believe in my judgment.

656
00:51:57,480 --> 00:51:59,520
You are the first one who believes me.

657
00:52:08,280 --> 00:52:08,720
Right.

658
00:52:09,880 --> 00:52:10,840
I have another thing to tell you.

659
00:52:16,560 --> 00:52:17,840
You seem to have many things to say.

660
00:52:20,080 --> 00:52:21,480
The owner of the photo studio 
asked me to tell you this.

661
00:52:22,400 --> 00:52:24,200
What you tried to pressure him to tell you, 

662
00:52:25,520 --> 00:52:27,320
he said you should talk to Boss Aang yourself.

663
00:52:32,960 --> 00:52:35,440
If there’s anything I can help with,  
You can always tell me.

664
00:52:36,000 --> 00:52:37,520
I’m willing to do anything to help you.

665
00:52:38,400 --> 00:52:39,240
Anything?

666
00:52:42,680 --> 00:52:46,840
Can you tell me something about you 
that you haven’t told me?

667
00:52:51,160 --> 00:52:52,160
Why are you saying that?

668
00:53:01,080 --> 00:53:05,160
I promised Dad that I would take care of you 
and wouldn’t hurt you.

669
00:53:08,360 --> 00:53:09,440
You lied to me.

670
00:53:10,440 --> 00:53:11,760
You acted like I was not his son.

671
00:53:15,200 --> 00:53:16,200
I want to know 

672
00:53:17,400 --> 00:53:20,920
if you are hiding something from me.

673
00:53:21,640 --> 00:53:25,040
You told me that I can trust you.

674
00:53:27,200 --> 00:53:28,960
