684
00:54:37,520 --> 00:54:39,160
I’ll also buy you a Chinese cruller.

685
00:54:40,160 --> 00:54:41,160
You should let me buy you a soy milk.

686
00:54:41,520 --> 00:54:43,960
I’m a right-hand man of Hongsen Gaoyod.

687
00:54:44,160 --> 00:54:45,760
He’s a big gangster in Thonburi.

688
00:54:45,760 --> 00:54:47,360
He’s handsome and talented.

689
00:54:48,120 --> 00:54:49,600
He is well-known. 

690
00:54:50,640 --> 00:54:51,800
Let me buy you soy milk.

691
